The policy doesn't know what HTTP request is being sent.

Layer 7 Policy

Cilium can inspect:

Plain Text
HTTP
HTTPS (with visibility/TLS considerations)
gRPC
Kafka
DNS
 

and make decisions based on:

Plain Text
HTTP Method
URL Path
Headers
DNS Query
Kafka Topic

This is called Layer 7 policy enforcement.

Example

Application:

