L4 = Which Port? (TCP/UDP)
L7 = What Request? (HTTP/gRPC/DNS)

Example:

Plain Text
Frontend -> Backend
 
L3 : Allow Pod
L4 : Allow Port 80
L7 : Allow GET /health
Deny POST /admin

This is one of the biggest advantages of Cilium over traditional networking solutions and is frequently discussed in senior Kubernetes networking interviews.

